  /// A list of columns by which the table is partitioned. Only primitive
  /// types are supported as partition keys. When you create a table used by
  /// Amazon Athena, and you do not specify any partitionKeys , you must at
  /// least set the value of partitionKeys to an empty list. For example:
  /// "PartitionKeys": []
